# Unit09
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit09核心词汇

coach/koʊtʃ/教练；辅导/The coach trained the team for the competition.
coal/koʊl/煤炭/Coal is still a major source of energy.
coast/koʊst/海岸/They drove along the coast enjoying the view.
coat/koʊt/外套；涂层/She wore a warm coat in the cold weather.
code/koʊd/代码；法规/You need a code to access the system.
coffee/ˈkɒfi/咖啡/I'd like a cup of coffee, please.
coin/kɔɪn/硬币/He found an old coin on the ground.
cold/koʊld/寒冷的；感冒/The water is very cold in winter.
collapse/kəˈlæps/倒塌；崩溃/The old building collapsed in the earthquake.
colleague/ˈkɑːliːɡ/同事/She gets along well with her colleagues.
collect/kəˈlekt/收集；领取/He collects stamps as a hobby.
college/ˈkɑːlɪdʒ/大学；学院/She went to college in Beijing.
colony/ˈkɑːləni/殖民地/The country was once a British colony.
color/ˈkʌlər/颜色/What is your favorite color?
column/ˈkɑːləm/栏目；柱子/He writes a weekly column for the newspaper.
combine/kəmˈbaɪn/结合；联合/We should combine our efforts to solve the problem.
come/kʌm/来/Come to my office after class.
comfort/ˈkʌmfərt/安慰；舒适/She offered comfort to the crying child.
command/kəˈmænd/命令；指挥/The general gave the command to attack.
comment/ˈkɑːment/评论/She made a comment about the new policy.
commit/kəˈmɪt/犯；承诺/He committed a serious crime.
committee/kəˈmɪti/委员会/The committee will meet next Monday.
common/ˈkɑːmən/常见的；共同的/Bikes are a common means of transport here.
communicate/kəˈmjuːnɪkeɪt/交流；传达/It's important to communicate clearly.
community/kəˈmjuːnəti/社区/She is very active in the local community.
company/ˈkʌmpəni/公司；陪伴/He works for a multinational company.
compare/kəmˈper/比较/You can't compare apples and oranges.
compete/kəmˈpiːt/竞争/Several companies are competing for the contract.
complain/kəmˈpleɪn/抱怨/He always complains about the weather.
complete/kəmˈpliːt/完成；完全的/She completed the project ahead of schedule.
complex/ˈkɑːmpleks/复杂的/The problem is more complex than we thought.
component/kəmˈpoʊnənt/组成部分/Quality is a key component of success.
computer/kəmˈpjuːtər/计算机/Computers have changed our lives dramatically.
concentrate/ˈkɑːnsntreɪt/集中；专注/Please concentrate on your studies.
concept/ˈkɑːnsept/概念/The concept of freedom means different things to different people.
concern/kənˈsɜːrn/关心；涉及/Environmental protection is a major concern.
conclude/kənˈkluːd/结束；得出结论/We concluded that the experiment was successful.
condition/kənˈdɪʃn/条件；状况/The roads are in poor condition after the storm.
conduct/kənˈdʌkt/进行；行为/The scientist conducted an important experiment.
conference/ˈkɑːnfərəns/会议/An international conference was held in Shanghai.
confident/ˈkɑːnfɪdənt/自信的/She is confident about passing the exam.
confirm/kənˈfɜːrm/确认/Please confirm your reservation by email.
conflict/ˈkɑːnflɪkt/冲突/There is a conflict between the two groups.
confuse/kənˈfjuːz/使困惑/The instructions confused me.
congress/ˈkɑːŋɡrəs/国会；代表大会/Congress passed a new law yesterday.
connect/kəˈnekt/连接/The bridge connects the two towns.
conscious/ˈkɑːnʃəs/有意识的/He was conscious of his own limitations.
consent/kənˈsent/同意；许可/You need parental consent for this activity.
consequence/ˈkɑːnsɪkwens/结果；后果/He suffered the consequences of his actions.
consider/kənˈsɪdər/考虑/Please consider all the options carefully.
